      "review_description": "The price was not the cheapest but the communication was helpful and genuine. Having a local installer hopefully offers some longterm security.Choice of inverters was limited and for that and panel quality I took Ocean Solar on their word.The tin roof complains most of the day as it heats up and cools down, a feature of the fixings I suspect.The installers were a happy bunch which usually reflects a company that has good management. I would recommend them. However, if you want to go a premium off grid system you had better do your research and be prepared to spend more money.",
