      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I got several quotes for solar from three different installers. Ocean Solar were the only ones to ask me about current and planned future electricity usage. They provided two quotes for different size systems, and after some careful thought i also decided on some upgrades. The revised quote was provided within a day, and subsequently accepted!Following this, installation was scheduled promptly, the team turned up on time and were done within a day. The site was left tidy and all work was of good quality. They even went out of their way to assist me out of hours to get connected to the Solar Monitoring App.All in all, exceptional service from Ocean Solar, i will certainly be recommending them.",
